title: The Unemployed
subtitle: The labour exchanges fill up.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: rf_party
view-if: rf_unemployed_timer <= 0 and (year > 1923 or month >= 4)
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rf_unemployed_timer = 4

= The Unemployed

Short time and unemployment spread as the occupation strangles the Ruhr. The unemployed have time, anger and nothing to lose.

- @councils
- @unions

@councils
title: Organise unemployed councils.
subtitle: Raises the revolutionary mood and the party's numbers; the police take note.
on-arrival: {!
Q.rev_situation += 2;
Q.members += 2;
Q.repression += 1;
window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

Councils of the unemployed march on the welfare offices.

@unions
title: Push the unions to fight for them.
subtitle: More union influence; slower results.
on-arrival: {!
Q.union_influence += 2;
window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

Communist union members raise the unemployed at every branch meeting.
